From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefan Hertenberger <erde74@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 23:34:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 07/26] plan9: rustc for 9front builds (static, its LLVM
 inside)

rustc-main takes rustc_driver_impl directly (no dylibs: rustc_driver is
one); dll_path is the program itself (current_exe: $sysroot/bin/rustc);
path_to_c_string via std::os::plan9's OsStrExt; libc and libloading from
9front-rust (libloading: no dynamic libraries, opening one fails, so no
proc macros for a rustc that runs on 9front). bootstrap: a target with an
llvm-config of its own that runs on the build host (9front-rust's
llvm-config for build/llvm-plan9) gives rustc_llvm that one.

./x build --stage 2 --host x86_64-unknown-plan9 --target x86_64-unknown-plan9 compiler/rustc

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
